    "description": {
      "value": "Armor made of djezet alloy is easy to enchant. Transferring runes onto djezet armor from other armor waives the usual 1/10 cost to etch the rune. This benefit has no effect on the cost of the rune itself or on the cost to transfer a rune off djezet armor onto a non-djezet armor. High-grade djezet armor can be etched with an additional property rune (to a maximum of four instead of three for +3 armor).\n\n**Craft Requirements:** The initial raw materials must include at least 17,500 gp of djezet + 1,750 gp per Bulk."
